{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>JAMs</strong></u> is a clicker game with Steam items themed around art and music, served in jars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, the scope of the game will be a quite simple clicker game with items but will evolve over time to become something special.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is <i>free to play</i> so everyone will be able to get drops, but with the <strong><u>Extra Drops DLC</u></strong> you will get a few more, it will be a fair distribution and there may be a few special items only available through the item shop in the future, but for now the daily drop creations are all that we have ever had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The schedule of items being removed from the drop pool will be a reliable thing and rotate quite frequently, so you will need to idle the game all the time in order to get all the drops.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is art-and-music themed, so if you are an artist (or just love it!) be sure to join the <strong>JAMs Discord Server</strong> and follow along with the project as we grow!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"JAMMIN'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/f873cb388d9dd5658a6d75fd69169e56b2c2d2ed.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Clicker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/0b451162995f789c6d1406d489f3be3d497bb87f.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Frenzy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/d4006ae43c0eecd1c9e78894558e3b21b6f61a33.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Agility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/ab75844280e679d4552e76f2a9d9e3d980a427e5.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Overdrive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/f4561ae2bb435e8dcd0b8cbe432000d7bd69c843.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Chaos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/b49a5ad1ed69bbb9ee7d6920caeae5ffeb329c6d.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Mayhem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/982ae6586a32ac5e013790ea8fdb59d7440f8ff4.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Juggernaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/cc2a6b36cd5bad6c2653a26a3228df6b0779546c.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/05654e2dfc522019c6d9f9446b1832834c63a3d8.jpg"},{"name":"JAMs Bound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220730/f1951b1388cfad887ddfe08aead9a43537726419.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220730?t=1770308482","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770308482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220730/5a692133e2b8994ab050119e2b51eeb5b7f2fd13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770308482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220730/5a692133e2b8994ab050119e2b51eeb5b7f2fd13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770308482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>JAMs</strong></u> is a clicker game with Steam items themed around art and music, served in jars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, the scope of the game will be a quite simple clicker game with items but will evolve over time to become something special.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is <i>free to play</i> so everyone will be able to get drops, but with the <strong><u>Extra Drops DLC</u></strong> you will get a few more, it will be a fair distribution and there may be a few special items only available through the item shop in the future, but for now the daily drop creations are all that we have ever had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The schedule of items being removed from the drop pool will be a reliable thing and rotate quite frequently, so you will need to idle the game all the time in order to get all the drops.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is art-and-music themed, so if you are an artist (or just love it!) be sure to join the <strong>JAMs Discord Server</strong> and follow along with the project as we grow!</p>","developers":["BlackSails.com"],"dlc":[3263290,3459270],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220730/header.jpg?t=1770308482","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 Dual Core 2nd Gen+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Not Required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad Core 2nd Gen+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</